<title>INDONESIA: Indorama says 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Indorama says 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian polyester maker PT Indorama Synthetics said on Tuesday the company posted a net profit of 122 billion rupiah in 1996 against 120 billion rupiah in 1995.</p>
<p>The company also said Indorama expected to book a net profit of 148 billion rupiah and total sales of 934 billion rupiah in 1997.</p>
</text>
